e_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ltL7/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6cd7563b-ecbc-4546-8b1f-5ca5d1e195ff","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"結局複数テーブルを1つのテーブルに見せてるのと変わらないので。物理的に別のディスクに配置されてるかもですが。","ts":"1630730769.054500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lV18"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6780c843-6262-4b98-b1cf-f6e1eb5be1e0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"えっとパーティショニング自体は相当に歴史が長いんですよね。そんで大規模データの統計処理にはあんま向かない。なので今ではそこを補う手段がいろいろあるよって印象。","ts":"1630730738.053900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kEL8B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f44cb93e-b46d-48d8-86ac-bb2317f923e3","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"正しくは「パーティショニング」でした。テーブルを分割して管理する手法ですね。","ts":"1630730651.052900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GI/wF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d06c7afb-e223-4562-8d61-b933e9d42a41","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"大量データとパーミッションが結び付かない。。パーティション?","ts":"1630730511.051800","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1630730532.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C9Pld"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77fe078e-271b-4025-b1ca-38ec92ee7879","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"大量データを扱う予定であればパーティショニング技術の知識も必要かも。","ts":"1630730450.051600","edited":{"user":"U022PB40WAF","ts":"1630730763.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0kq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e62b40b8-c5e6-4cb8-b8f9-0fd3c883533b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"DuckDBとかそうかもしれんな","ts":"1630730407.051000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5VGu9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4000777b-569d-40c3-99a2-98abd21898ee","type":"message","user":"UDP